file tools/fixtures/r/readme_reach_control.sh the pen, eight cases to fifteen
file tools/g/generated_page_freshness_witness.rish the hook's own witness, fourteen behaviors to sixteen
file tools/fixtures/g/generated_page_freshness_control.sh rule six bitten and then waved through on a real repository
file construction/REDS.md %524 CLOSED, the fourth firing recorded and the class taken
file construction/ITINERARY.md the Incense account, elder shelved to make room
file construction/archive/20260907-144041_itinerary-landed-accounts.md the shelved elder account
scope one lap: recover a parked round, close %524, land the wall
status landed, roster hot green, sent
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- six ships run tools/hooks/pre-commit, so a wall that refuses wrongly is a fleet that cannot commit; rule six refuses by name and never rewrites, and whether that reading belongs at the commit at all is your word.
